prompt.facts:
        Use ONLY these facts. If a fact is "(not captured)", do not guess it.
        - Failing check: {rule_summary}
        - Technical detail from the scanner: {technical_description}
        - WCAG criterion: {sc_code} {sc_name} (Level {level}, {principle})
        - Severity: {severity}
        - Page URL: {page_url}
        - What the screen reader says for this element today: {current_announcement}
        - Where the element sits on the page:
{element_context}
        - Scanner help link: {help_url}
        - Test case description: {testcase_description}
        - Test case actual result: {testcase_actual_result}
        - Element HTML (may be cut short; "..." means omitted):
{element_html}
